  "adminMobileSecurityEphemeralMode_feature_discoveryDescription": "With Mattermost Enterprise Advanced, you can enable Mobile Ephemeral Mode to enforce data persistence policies on mobile devices. Configure disconnection timeouts, offline data retention, and automatic cache cleanup.",
