  "adminMobileSecurityEphemeralModeAutoCacheCleanupRange": "Must be a number between 0 and 60 days.",
  "adminMobileSecurityEphemeralModeAutoCacheCleanupDescription": "Controls the maximum age of any content cached on the device, regardless of connection status. Prevents unbounded accumulation of sensitive data. Set to 0 for zero-persistence mode where content is never persisted to disk.",
