  "adminServiceMaximumPayloadSizeDescription": "The maximum number of bytes allowed in the payload of incoming HTTP calls",
  "adminServiceMfaDesc": "When true, users with AD/LDAP or email login can add multi-factor authentication to their account using an authenticator app.",
