  "adminServiceRevokeNonCompliantTokensDescription": "Permanently revokes all existing personal access tokens that do not comply with the maximum lifetime above (tokens that never expire or expire beyond the cap). The maximum lifetime only applies to newly created tokens, so use this to bring already-issued tokens into compliance. Bot account tokens are exempt. You will be shown how many tokens are affected before confirming.",
